msgstr "Conserver cette loi : gmeow:ItemSettlingScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:settledBy ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceMemberScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
